                "8810e015dc271e4c7cadafefa983ad004ae66c5f"
            ],
            "ref": "refs/changes/50/90750/2",
            "uploader": {
                "name": "Alexander",
                "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                "username": "pointbazaar"
            },
            "createdOn": 1780066763,
            "author": {
                "name": "Alexander",
                "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                "username": "pointbazaar"
            },
            "kind": "REWORK",
            "comments": [
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/ObjectMapper.interface.yaml",
                    "line": 257,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Patrick Williams",
                        "email": "patrick@stwcx.xyz",
                        "username": "williamspatrick"
                    },
                    "message": "I know there are a bunch of strings where there should be object paths already in this interface.  Do we want to do new methods \"right\" (ie. with object paths) or do we want them strings for consistency?\n\n@bradleyb@fuzziesquirrel.com"
                },
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/ObjectMapper.interface.yaml",
                    "line": 257,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Brad Bishop",
                        "email": "bradleyb@fuzziesquirrel.com",
                        "username": "bradbishop"
                    },
                    "message": "I would vote for doing it right going forward.\n\nTo avoid dead interfaces (and dead mapper code), should we hold off on merging this until we get feedback from the user of this proposed interface (@ed@tanous.net)?  Matt had asked for that in the mapper review for the implementation."
                },
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/ObjectMapper.interface.yaml",
                    "line": 257,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alexander",
                        "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "Yes, agree, we should not merge code dead on arrival."
                },
                {
                    "file": "yaml/xyz/openbmc_project/ObjectMapper.interface.yaml",
                    "line": 257,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Alexander",
                        "email": "alexander.hansen@9elements.com",
                        "username": "pointbazaar"
                    },
                    "message": "> I would vote for doing it right going forward.\n\ndone, adjusted to `object_path`\n\n> until we get feedback from the user of this proposed interface\n\nOverall i think we should not wait on feedback from anyone for more than one month. \nNot sure what to do in this situation."
                }
            ],
